    <briefdescription>
<para>Adapts any <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_i_l_l_m_provider" kindref="compound">ILLMProvider</ref></computeroutput> for use as an <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_i_reflection_provider" kindref="compound">IReflectionProvider</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><bold>Adapter pattern</bold>: translates <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_i_reflection_provider" kindref="compound">IReflectionProvider</ref></computeroutput>&apos;s four-method interface into <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_i_l_l_m_provider_1a634950a81c986e68988e4f73930273e9" kindref="member">ILLMProvider::complete()</ref></computeroutput> calls, with <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_dynamic_reflection_prompt_builder" kindref="compound">DynamicReflectionPromptBuilder</ref></computeroutput> producing the strategy-specific prompts.</para>
<para>Strategy and self-aware context behaviour are inherited from the <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_dynamic_reflection_prompt_builder" kindref="compound">DynamicReflectionPromptBuilder</ref></computeroutput> that is embedded in the adapter and configurable via <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_i_l_l_m_provider_reflection_adapter_1af4bbee80ab38304c2aad4e3f8e7a5b2d" kindref="member">setStrategy()</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
<para>Quality scoring falls back to a built-in heuristic when no <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_i_reflection_scorer" kindref="compound">IReflectionScorer</ref></computeroutput> is injected. The heuristic rewards length and structured content, and penalises hallucination marker phrases. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
